```python id=app_golden
import numpy as np
I = np.eye(2, dtype=complex)
Hd = np.array([[1, 1], [1, -1]], dtype=complex) / np.sqrt(2)
Sd = np.diag([1, -1j]).astype(complex)                # S† (phase gate dagger)
CZ = np.diag([1, 1, 1, -1]).astype(complex)
# B₂ up to global phase e^{iπ/4} = (H⊗H)(S†⊗S†)CZ(H⊗H)  (Majorana exp(π/4 γ₂γ₃)=exp(iπ/4 X₀X₁))
golden = np.kron(Hd, Hd) @ np.kron(Sd, Sd) @ CZ @ np.kron(Hd, Hd)
```
